            "en": "“सूक्तम्,” you say, “su-uktam, a good saying,” and the lotus statue turns her head, with a small grinding sound, towards you. Her fine crack closes a little. “विद्यालयः,” she says, to Lubdhaka's foreman. “महात्मा. सूक्तम्.” She lowers her lotus, and the foreman takes a step back. He did not know that stone could speak.",
